{#
  Page tab row (1.16, B-Q1) of the read and edit views, under the page header: Page / Edit / History (View\AreaNav from
  WikiPageFactory::pageTabs(), rendered by the UiKit `tabs` theme partial at the secondary level; the current view
  has aria-current="page"). 1.18: each tab passes its icon (AreaNavItem::icon, web_ui.tab_icons), so the row follows
  the host's tab style (text, icon and text, or icon only with the label on the current tab and as tooltip). Then —
  only with comments.enabled and WikiAction::ViewComments — the comments toggle at the end of the same row: the UiKit
  `side_panel_toggle` theme partial as an icon button (tabler:message-circle) whose visible count badge (open threads
  the viewer may read) is also part of its accessible name ("Comments 3 open"; "Comments" alone at 0). Without
  JavaScript the toggle is a link to ?comments=1 (?comments=0 when open).
  Variables: tabs (View\AreaNav), comments (WikiCommentsPanel::panel() or null), bundle.
  1.29: the toggle is _comments_toggle.html.twig; with web_ui.page_header.layout: compact this row is not printed (the
  tabs and the toggle go into the header, _page_header_compact.html.twig).
  1.30: host_toolbar (block wiki_page_header_toolbar / web_ui.slots.page_header_toolbar) and tree_toggle
  (web_ui.tree_collapsed_mode: hidden) are printed at the end of the row, before the comments toggle.
#}
{% trans_default_domain 'NowoWikiBundle' %}
{% set _b = bundle|default(null) %}
{% set _items = [] %}
{% for item in tabs.items %}
    {% set _items = _items|merge([{label: item.label, href: item.href, current: item.active, attr: item.attributes, icon: item.icon}]) %}
{% endfor %}
<div class="nowo-wiki-tabs" data-testid="wiki-tabs">
    {{ include(nowo_ui_partial('tabs', _b), {
        items: _items,
        aria_label: tabs.label is null ? null : (tabs.label.key is defined ? tabs.label.key|trans(tabs.label.params, tabs.label.domain) : tabs.label),
        level: 'secondary',
        bundle: _b,
    }, false) }}
    {% set _host = host_toolbar|default('')|trim %}
    {% set _tree = tree_toggle|default('')|trim %}
    {% if comments|default(null) or _host is not empty or _tree is not empty %}
        <div class="nowo-wiki-tabs__end">
            {{- _host|raw -}}{{- _tree|raw -}}
            {% if comments|default(null) %}{{ include('@NowoWikiBundle/manage/_comments_toggle.html.twig', {comments: comments, bundle: _b}, false) }}{% endif %}
        </div>
    {% endif %}
</div>
